      "body": "## Motivation\n\nA transient GitHub API 500/502 can fail `check-pr-test-health` before any tests run. These failures are tracked in #42752 (I11, I14, I17, I31, I33, I34 and I36) and are still recurring: I17, I31, I33, I34 and I36 were all last seen on 2026-10-20, across `1-gpu-h100`, `2-gpu-h100`, `4-gpu-b200`, `8-gpu-b300` and `8-gpu-h20` runners.\n\n## Modifications\n\nSet `actions/github-script`'s `retries` to 2, as `check-maintenance` already does. This retries individual API requests; real lint and sibling-job failures still fail the health check.\n\nThis covers `check-pr-test-health`. #42806 changes the separate `wait-for-jobs` action.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- `node --test .github/actions/check-pr-test-health/action.test.cjs`: 5 tests pass.\n- Local HTTP fault injection with the current action script and the real `github-script@v8` bundle: 11 cases pass. Without retries, an injected 500 fails immediately. With retries, transient 500/502 responses recover in lint, label lookup and paginated job lookup. Persistent lint/job-list API errors and real lint/job failures still fail; bypass labels still work.\n- Scoped pre-commit checks pass.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo inference code changes. Successful requests need no extra calls; a failing request can make up to two additional attempts.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format checks on the changed file.\n- [x] Run existing tests and targeted fault injection.\n- [x] Documentation: no user-facing API changes.\n- [x] Accuracy and speed: no inference changes.\n- [x] Follow SGLang code style.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\nReady for review. Repository CI requires a maintainer's `run-ci` label.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41241869099](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41241869099)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41241869266](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41241869266)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
