    {
      "body": "Gentle ping @Kangyan-Zhou @Fridge003 (CI oncalls per MAINTAINER.md). These 502s are still showing up in #42752 this week (I39, I41), where this PR is listed as the fix, and #42806 now uses the same retries: 2 approach for wait-for-jobs. Could you take a look? Thx! 谢谢，麻烦帮忙 review 一下 🙏",
