      }
    },
    {
      "body": "/tag-run-ci-label\n\nAdding `run-ci` so this can be tested. It's the companion to #42806 and covers the other caller of the same API: on #46926 (run 41074304323, attempt 2), `check-pr-test-health` itself failed in `base-b-test-1-gpu-large (1)` with `HttpError: terminated` from the jobs API. `wait-for-base-b` then failed on that job, and base-c was skipped.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-30T23:48:23Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/45169#issuecomment-6535960319",
      "id": 6535960319,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-30T23:48:23Z",
      "user": {
