      }
    },
    {
      "body": "> /tag-run-ci-label\r\n> \r\n> Adding `run-ci` so this can be tested. It's the companion to #42806 and covers the other caller of the same API: on #46926 (run 41074304323, attempt 2), `check-pr-test-health` itself failed in `base-b-test-1-gpu-large (1)` with `HttpError: terminated` from the jobs API. `wait-for-base-b` then failed on that job, and base-c was skipped.\r\n\r\nThanks @leejnau for picking this up and adding run-ci! I merged main into the branch so CI runs with the label now. Could you take a look when you have a chance?",
